a bit of the ball game"}, "bookmarkCount": 0, "replyCount": 0, "repostCount": 0, "likeCount": 5, "quoteCount": 0, "indexedAt": "2026-10-29T01:07:04.072Z", "labels": []}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:fkpnckg4eqizwxmgrxrgwyxo/app.bsky.feed.post/3myy37a4xgs2a", "cid": "bafyreib7aubt4pgzst3etj7i4hs2nukl3ti6vmmf7yujdgwts6r5fwuih4", "author": {"did": "did:plc:fkpnckg4eqizwxmgrxrgwyxo", "handle": "philiprr.bsky.social", "displayName": "Philip Rossman-Reich", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:fkpnckg4eqizwxmgrxrgwyxo/bafkreia5yytn63svxtqdkdptgsmyydn6pq4k5kko77upzeyupxjbgkwkke", "associated": {"activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [], "createdAt": "2023-08-18T16:37:49.540Z"}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-10-29T01:06:33.328Z", "facets": [{"features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#tag", "tag": "Raptors"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 12, "byteStart": 4}}, {"features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#tag", "tag": "Magic"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 71, "byteStart": 65}}], "langs": ["en"], "reply": {"parent": {"cid": "bafyreie2vtjhadlrj25x3svtrujqmz2744sxclqwvhrfichmfxzlb3j3ay", "uri": "at://did:plc:fkpnckg4eqizwxmgrxrgwyxo/app.bsky.feed.post/3myy25zljk22a"}, "root": {"cid": "bafyreigjyqwct2o2cay4qdfwgcttbip6thbc7wooqzns3rq4typazgbqma", "uri": "at://did:plc:fkpnckg4eqizwxmgrxrgwyxo/app.bsky.feed.post/3myxvqv44lk2a"}}, "text": "The #Raptors are just bottling up Franz Wagner and they know the #Magic have no one else they need to worry about attacking downhill. Very little movement. And Franz has not been able to kick out cleanly when the D collapses.\n\nORL 53:77 TOR 9:57 3rd"}, "bookmarkCount": 0, "replyCount": 1, "repostCount": 0, "likeCount": 1, "quoteCount": 0, "indexedAt": "2026-10-29T01:06:33.871Z", "labels": []}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:dlrethrp3boha4lzrci5zg74/app.bsky.feed.post/3myy36fwei22g", "cid": "bafyreib4wyudbayrnczgfzrwyhgiupyswm2cuciobbacr3di7pi3tf7yyq", "author": {"did": "did:plc:dlrethrp3boha4lzrci5zg74", "handle": "shantz.bsky.social", "displayName": "Matt Shantz", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:dlrethrp3boha4lzrci5zg74/bafkreicocz3f5roaj2h7wpqnqzce6jvvbvrf3jxq3t5m4c2vdgokpsw6ri", "associated": {"chat": {"allowIncoming": "all"}, "activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [], "createdAt": "2023-07-17T01:11:00.286Z"}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-10-29T01:06:05.840Z", "langs": ["en"], "text": "I'd feel a lot better if the Raptors could stretch this 22 point lead to a 39 point lead."}, "bookmarkCount": 0, "replyCount": 0, "repostCount": 0, "likeCount": 1, "quoteCount": 0, "indexedAt": "2026-10-29T01:06:06.099Z", "labels": []}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:fkpnckg4eqizwxmgrxrgwyxo/app.bsky.feed.post/3myy2w56a3c2a", "cid": "bafyreifpdqlotenytrmrbdsxtj74w7agp6fuyyb3olq6arv2mmbt3t3tci", "author": {"did": "did:plc:fkpnckg4eqizwxmgrxrgwyxo", "handle": "philiprr.bsky.social", "displayName": "Philip Rossman-Reich", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:fkpnckg4eqizwxmgrxrgwyxo/bafkreia5yytn63svxtqdkdptgsmyydn6pq4k5kko77upzeyupxjbgkwkke", "associated": {"activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [], "createdAt": "2023-08-18T16:37:49.540Z"}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-10-29T01:01:28.233Z", "langs": ["en"], "reply": {"parent": {"cid": "bafyreihjjwadrc3pqcaujqkwjhakj4ge46spzyrbtbi7c6sk6dqvzrv6t4", "uri": "at://did:plc:yi75tgilvcbpesdvtxrxcb7m/app.bsky.feed.post/3myy2hqjtzw2w"}, "root": {"$type": "com.atproto.repo.strongRef", "cid": "bafyreibi6ub2nxxmh3avnru5h72b4v6xdojptvzozchoj3tvg6wy7jox5u", "uri": "at://did:plc:fkpnckg4eqizwxmgrxrgwyxo/app.bsky.feed.post/3myxyikbcw22a"}}, "text": "His turnovers are the biggest thing giving the Raptors separation tonight."}, "bookmarkCount": 0, "replyCount": 0, "repostCount": 0, "likeCount": 0, "quoteCount": 0, "indexedAt": "2026-10-29T01:01:28.780Z", "labels": []}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:l7zwg5onozdwgpgujxqbsina/app.bsky.feed.post/3myy2p7e4gk2d", "cid": "bafyreibzhpdy7hjllhz24hzk3ss6oscjd5polaardjnhmlwcpvzbjulv6y", "author": {"did": "did:plc:l7zwg5onozdwgpgujxqbsina", "handle": "thefwordnb.bsky.social", "displayName": "Steven Clark", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:l7zwg5onozdwgpgujxqbsina/bafkreicxt2kbwriagbr36jmr74zw2whdbctbuehc36tq6fqqut4iqqeevi", "associated": {"activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [{"src": "did:plc:l7zwg5onozdwgpgujxqbsina", "uri": "at://did:plc:l7zwg5onozdwgpgujxqbsina/app.bsky.actor.profile/self", "cid": "bafyreigc7c7idrlqdle7yx7ozmqqyzd3m5j2nkyrlvvciaj2fxilcklnzq", "val": "!no-unauthenticated", "cts": "1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z"}], "createdAt": "2023-07-06T17:14:23.357Z"}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-10-29T00:57:35.643Z", "langs": ["en"], "text": "I would be watching Oilers hockey but also watching baseball and Raptors. Can't channel surf when a game is on Prime so hockey is out of the rotation"}, "bookmarkCount": 0, "replyCount": 0, "repostCount": 1, "likeCount": 2, "quoteCount": 0, "indexedAt": "2026-10-29T00:57:36.082Z", "labels": []}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:3ph7mooqt5acnzv53x5copif/app.bsky.feed.post/3myy2jd33nk2w", "cid": "bafyreifpxxv4mutip2qfysih7coy33mlt6i7dkxgtl7d56xru2yrb34uya", "author": {"did": "did:plc:3ph7mooqt5acnzv53x5copif", "handle": "palaeohammer.bsky.social", "displayName": "The Palaeontologist's Hammer", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:3ph7mooqt5acnzv53x5copif/bafkreiea26pdntsqrmcda6rmydsj5whp3c67gdj2zqfr5buf5swrfxqvam", "associated": {"chat": {"allowIncoming": "all"}, "activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [], "createdAt": "2024-11-13T05:59:19.282Z"}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-10-29T00:54:18.214Z", "langs": ["en"], "text": "Halftime Takeaways\nRaptors picked up their NINTH turnover with 10:17 left in 2Q.\n\nThey had 1 turnover the rest of the quarter, and were +13 in that time. \n\nThey appear to have the talent edge. As long as they play their game and execute, they should win this one"}, "bookmarkCount": 0, "replyCount": 0, "repostCount": 0, "likeCount": 0, "quoteCount": 0, "indexedAt": "2026-10-29T00:54:18.682Z", "labels": []}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:75ywphuamkbx76cq6efue5y5/app.bsky.feed.post/3myy2efctpc2a", "cid": "bafyreighczdqd4wa45jz4shrhazm2asp4vnqwhdshceix37u2ox4ge4d4i", "author": {"did": "did:plc:75ywphuamkbx76cq6efue5y5", "handle": "jlewenberg.bsky.social", "displayName": "Josh Lewenberg", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:75ywphuamkbx76cq6efue5y5/bafkreih7kszzs5gl72sg5igovpbjfglyrxgpzrq4dfzi27zy5dgx5ep3im", "associated": {"chat": {"allowIncoming": "none"}, "activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [], "createdAt": "2024-11-30T19:46:50.450Z", "verification": {"verifications": [{"issuer": "did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur", "issuerDisplayName": "Bluesky", "issuerHandle": "bsky.app", "uri": "at://did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur/app.bsky.graph.verification/3m4y5jsuu272r", "isValid": true, "createdAt": "2025-11-06T18:02:50.132Z"}], "verifiedStatus": "valid", "trustedVerifierStatus": "none"}}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-10-29T00:51:32.794Z", "langs": ["en"], "text": "The Raptors have now forced 88 turnovers in 14 quarters this season. That's as many as Portland and New Orleans have forced, combined."}, "bookmarkCount": 0, "replyCount": 0, "repostCount": 2, "likeCount": 14, "quoteCount": 0, "indexedAt": "2026-10-29T00:51:32.980Z", "labels": []}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:efktoi7qah3byyvuygczxjls/app.bsky.feed.post/3myy2e44pls2l", "cid": "bafyreic3u7qp7wwm73bfh7ergxwmslwgrbicjn7ae6ujj642vevmz7ovgi", "author": {"did": "did:plc:efktoi7qah3byyvuygczxjls", "handle": "vivekmjacob.bsky.social", "displayName": "Vivek Jacob", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:efktoi7qah3byyvuygczxjls/bafkreiaqsgf7cwyeyqfm5rc5kvw2aw2bxrsutevjwqhn3imcr35klbvjve", "associated": {"chat": {"allowIncoming": "none"}, "activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [], "createdAt": "2024-11-13T19:42:54.982Z"}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-10-29T00:51:23.155Z", "langs": ["en"], "text": "After a 21-13 start for the Magic, it's been 56-32 Raptors to take a 16pt lead into halftime.\n\nRJ leading the way with 21, solid two-way game from IQ, Scottie very impactful, Ja'Kobe continuing to be awesome, best we've seen of Shead in the early season."}, "bookmarkCount": 0, "replyCount": 1, "repostCount": 0, "likeCount": 5, "quoteCount": 0, "indexedAt": "2026-10-29T00:51:23.185Z", "labels": []}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:e7fdktkwv37ws6rljgnoljfz/app.bsky.feed.post/3myy2bvruas2h", "cid": "bafyreigrwrifyumwzesznlb2zyxj5y2mozzisfc62kw2pggkbghyzoya4m", "author": {"did": "did:plc:e7fdktkwv37ws6rljgnoljfz", "handle": "jbeede.bsky.social", "displayName": "Jason Beede", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:e7fdktkwv37ws6rljgnoljfz/bafkreiey3powizzh2yl5k4eyoftbxztccx6pgnmdozyhyyjqybjhhnc2ne", "associated": {"activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [], "createdAt": "2024-11-20T04:46:42.270Z"}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-10-29T00:50:09.399Z", "facets": [{"features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#tag", "tag": "Magic"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 28, "byteStart": 22}}], "langs": ["en"], "text": "Halftime: Raptors 69, #Magic 53\n\nFranz Wagner and Desmond Bane both have 11 points but they've shot a combined 6 for 18 (33%) from the floor. Tristan da Silva (2 for 2 from 3) has 10 points off the bench.\n\nOrlando has shot 5 for 18 from 3-point range and 12 for 17 at the FT line."}, "bookmarkCount": 0, "replyCount": 0, "repostCount": 0, "likeCount": 0, "quoteCount": 0, "indexedAt": "2026-10-29T00:50:09.674Z", "labels": []}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:75ywphuamkbx76cq6efue5y5/app.bsky.feed.post/3myy272akx22a", "cid": "bafyreiagrdkpubxi42ktz742unfcamn7mvneieseabvoixqmbfpqpj7zem", "author": {"did": "did:plc:75ywphuamkbx76cq6efue5y5", "handle": "jlewenberg.bsky.social", "displayName": "Josh Lewenberg", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:75ywphuamkbx76cq6efue5y5/bafkreih7kszzs5gl72sg5igovpbjfglyrxgpzrq4dfzi27zy5dgx5ep3im", "associated": {"chat": {"allowIncoming": "none"}, "activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [], "createdAt": "2024-11-30T19:46:50.450Z", "verification": {"verifications": [{"issuer": "did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur", "issuerDisplayName": "Bluesky", "issuerHandle": "bsky.app", "uri": "at://did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur/app.bsky.graph.verification/3m4y5jsuu272r", "isValid": true, "createdAt": "2025-11-06T18:02:50.132Z"}], "verifiedStatus": "valid", "trustedVerifierStatus": "none"}}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-10-29T00:48:33.411Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.images", "images": [{"alt": "", "aspectRatio": {"height": 1350, "width": 1080}, "image": {"$type": "blob", "ref": {"$link": "bafkreiblpdgxo4h2mfqqokrvrffiianuf55lyduj24qmeuucsaeueqblhm"}, "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "size": 951321}}]}, "langs": ["en"], "text": "RJ Barrett with 21 first-half points on 11 shots in 18 minutes. Also the Raptors' leading rebounder with 6 boards.\n\nDon't make me tap the sign \ud83d\udc47"}, "embed": {"images": [{"thumb": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:75ywphuamkbx76cq6efue5y5/bafkreiblpdgxo4h2mfqqokrvrffiianuf55lyduj24qmeuucsaeueqblhm", "fullsize": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:75ywphuamkbx76cq6efue5y5/bafkreiblpdgxo4h2mfqqokrvrffiianuf55lyduj24qmeuucsaeueqblhm", "alt": "", "aspectRatio": {"height": 1350, "width": 1080}}], "$type": "app.bsky.embed.images#view"}, "bookmarkCount": 0, "replyCount": 0, "repostCount": 8, "likeCount": 43, "quoteCount": 0, "indexedAt": "2026-10-29T00:48:36.671Z", "labels": []}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:fhyu4zjougtr3emjwdulollt/app.bsky.feed.post/3myy26qrbuk2b", "cid": "bafyreigg3naprwtr5y4jsnxgd5xampyjlihuos7hcgiq36rhcbwzzghrc4", "author": {"did": "did:plc:fhyu4zjougtr3emjwdulollt", "handle": "smithraptorsbeat.bsky.social", "displayName": "Doug Smith", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:fhyu4zjougtr3emjwdulollt/bafkreiajribnpdrs22kkygn2qxwwowyitv7otscl6mebx6kty7uijwrk3i", "associated": {"activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [], "createdAt": "2024-11-06T22:16:16.879Z"}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-10-29T00:48:23.475Z", "langs": ["en"], "text": "That was as good a quarter as the Raptors have played in the very young season.\nRJ's got 21, Toronto forces 14 Magic turnovers, Raptors make 8-18 3s\nToronto 69, Magic 53"}, "bookmarkCount": 0, "replyCount": 0, "repostCount": 0, "likeCount": 7, "quoteCount": 0, "indexedAt": "2026-10-29T00:48:23.875Z", "labels": []}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:fkpnckg4eqizwxmgrxrgwyxo/app.bsky.feed.post/3myy25zljk22a", "cid": "bafyreie2vtjhadlrj25x3svtrujqmz2744sxclqwvhrfichmfxzlb3j3ay", "author": {"did": "did:plc:fkpnckg4eqizwxmgrxrgwyxo", "handle": "philiprr.bsky.social", "displayName": "Philip Rossman-Reich", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:fkpnckg4eqizwxmgrxrgwyxo/bafkreia5yytn63svxtqdkdptgsmyydn6pq4k5kko77upzeyupxjbgkwkke", "associated": {"activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [], "createdAt": "2023-08-18T16:37:49.540Z"}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-10-29T00:47:59.169Z", "facets": [{"features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#tag", "tag": "Magic"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 10, "byteStart": 4}}, {"features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#tag", "tag": "Raptors"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 149, "byteStart": 141}}, {"features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#tag", "tag": "Raptors"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 181, "byteStart": 173}}], "langs": ["en"], "reply": {"parent": {"cid": "bafyreibf2pz5ygyrqzpqp55dztd4sjxgbfgj4q33s5ltzxraveldyjifvu", "uri": "at://did:plc:fkpnckg4eqizwxmgrxrgwyxo/app.bsky.feed.post/3myxzys4yv22a"}, "root": {"cid": "bafyreigjyqwct2o2cay4qdfwgcttbip6thbc7wooqzns3rq4typazgbqma", "uri": "at://did:plc:fkpnckg4eqizwxmgrxrgwyxo/app.bsky.feed.post/3myxvqv44lk2a"}}, "text": "The #Magic left a lot of opportunities on the board to take control of this game. Turnovers, missed free throws and bad transition D let the #Raptors get into their rhythm. #Raptors lead 69-53 at the half."}, "bookmarkCount": 0, "replyCount": 1, "repostCount": 0, "likeCount": 0, "quoteCount": 0, "indexedAt": "2026-10-29T00:47:59.875Z", "labels": []}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:ywsla6rhibn7h3w6oi6sgkrc/app.bsky.feed.post/3myy25vw4q22i", "cid": "bafyreifexm2afvrl7a6654ztbuct2c2dzj3zccqg4fpefzlwce6vqbldly", "author": {"did": "did:plc:ywsla6rhibn7h3w6oi6sgkrc", "handle": "nbarealtimestats.bsky.social", "displayName": "NBA Realtime Stats", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:ywsla6rhibn7h3w6oi6sgkrc/bafkreicch7wq2uorzqbeoaom3wn6pb627u4sftummbu7itbeo7sk63u3ne", "associated": {"activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [], "createdAt": "2024-11-15T11:53:40.921Z"}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-10-29T00:47:54.880772+00:00", "langs": ["en"], "reply": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post#replyRef", "parent": {"$type": "com.atproto.repo.strongRef", "cid": "bafyreiaxddl2w43aca2n5kuuggqvjonrf7ti644ekef6k7ypdajmgpllye", "uri": "at://did:plc:ywsla6rhibn7h3w6oi6sgkrc/app.bsky.feed.post/3myxyahhlec27"}, "root": {"$type": "com.atproto.repo.strongRef", "cid": "bafyreiaxddl2w43aca2n5kuuggqvjonrf7ti644ekef6k7ypdajmgpllye", "uri": "at://did:plc:ywsla6rhibn7h3w6oi6sgkrc/app.bsky.feed.post/3myxyahhlec27"}}, "text": "Halftime \u2014 Toronto Raptors lead by 16\n\nORL 53\nTOR 69\n\nRJ Barrett: 21 pts, 6 reb, 2 ast\nScottie Barnes: 10 pts, 4 reb, 2 ast\n\n#NBA #Raptors #Magic"}, "bookmarkCount": 0, "replyCount": 1, "repostCount": 0, "likeCount": 0, "quoteCount": 0, "indexedAt": "2026-10-29T00:47:55.479Z", "labels": []}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:dlrethrp3boha4lzrci5zg74/app.bsky.feed.post/3myy22j2mzk2k", "cid": "bafyreihutiokssuvrwjxvzvzomwekahxvota6cvjklssjyjnjjkhxo5cii", "author": {"did": "did:plc:dlrethrp3boha4lzrci5zg74", "handle": "shantz.bsky.social", "displayName": "Matt Shantz", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:dlrethrp3boha4lzrci5zg74/bafkreicocz3f5roaj2h7wpqnqzce6jvvbvrf3jxq3t5m4c2vdgokpsw6ri", "associated": {"chat": {"allowIncoming": "all"}, "activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [], "createdAt": "2023-07-17T01:11:00.286Z"}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-10-29T00:46:01.172Z", "langs": ["en"], "text": "Raptors opened this game up big while I was packing lunches for tomorrow, so I guess I gotta pack a few dozen more lunches to keep this moving."}, "bookmarkCount": 0, "replyCount": 1, "repostCount": 0, "likeCount": 5, "quoteCount": 0, "indexedAt": "2026-10-29T00:46:00.073Z", "labels": []}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:y3xahfdgzxpjsqogokmi43bt/app.bsky.feed.post/3myxzznguqs2j", "cid": "bafyreibxbyh6kfzpmdfbl4lcousmh6zdn57hugddlcigxwo6vxz3xagjn4", "author": {"did": "did:plc:y3xahfdgzxpjsqogokmi43bt", "handle": "blakemurphy.bsky.social", "displayName": "Blake Murphy", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:y3xahfdgzxpjsqogokmi43bt/bafkreiaqlur4c4jaie7c6dico5vncvaskkiphyhpkqzwuco5praatpfzve", "associated": {"chat": {"allowIncoming": "all"}, "activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [], "createdAt": "2023-05-07T18:58:18.525Z", "verification": {"verifications": [{"issuer": "did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur", "issuerDisplayName": "Bluesky", "issuerHandle": "bsky.app", "uri": "at://did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur/app.bsky.graph.verification/3m4cjft3aoe2v", "isValid": true, "createdAt": "2025-10-29T03:36:46.820Z"}], "verifiedStatus": "valid", "trustedVerifierStatus": "none"}}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-10-29T00:45:32.215Z", "langs": ["en"], "text": "That might be the best 8 minutes or so the Raptors have played this year.\n\nA lot of good process, decision making, guys upping their levels. And cool dunk."}, "bookmarkCount": 0, "replyCount": 0, "repostCount": 1, "likeCount": 29, "quoteCount": 0, "indexedAt": "2026-10-29T00:45:32.488Z", "labels": []}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:hcqpy5mwr5ytsg57fzk53ng7/app.bsky.feed.post/3myxzyvwarc2b", "cid": "bafyreibek4qajorc7hsaberqnrfqjqoy7x6sg4axchobuqdmpxqy5jkoqm", "author": {"did": "did:plc:hcqpy5mwr5ytsg57fzk53ng7", "handle": "chrispb.bsky.social", "displayName": "Glengarry Glen Rachel", "pronouns": "he/him", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:hcqpy5mwr5ytsg57fzk53ng7/bafkreiadcn2j77sdxkifgmwx2olbh4yi6itwjojv54jnbb2wqr44odwdsa", "associated": {"activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [{"src": "did:plc:hcqpy5mwr5ytsg57fzk53ng7", "uri": "at://did:plc:hcqpy5mwr5ytsg57fzk53ng7/app.bsky.actor.profile/self", "cid": "bafyreibgzfovamvydv3dfvqukd24jsbvyjlsw3d7veixzsnly2shr3s2ji", "val": "!no-unauthenticated", "cts": "1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z"}], "createdAt": "2023-07-07T22:26:53.884Z"}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-10-29T00:45:07.552Z", "facets": [{"features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#tag", "tag": "raptors"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 33, "byteStart": 25}}, {"features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#tag", "tag": "nba"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 38, "byteStart": 34}}], "langs": ["en"], "text": "No magic Halloween magic #raptors #nba"}, "bookmarkCount": 0, "replyCount": 0, "repostCount": 0, "likeCount": 0, "quoteCount": 0, "indexedAt": "2026-10-29T00:45:05.781Z", "labels": []}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:fkpnckg4eqizwxmgrxrgwyxo/app.bsky.feed.post/3myxzys4yv22a", "cid": "bafyreibf2pz5ygyrqzpqp55dztd4sjxgbfgj4q33s5ltzxraveldyjifvu", "author": {"did": "did:plc:fkpnckg4eqizwxmgrxrgwyxo", "handle": "philiprr.bsky.social", "displayName": "Philip Rossman-Reich", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:fkpnckg4eqizwxmgrxrgwyxo/bafkreia5yytn63svxtqdkdptgsmyydn6pq4k5kko77upzeyupxjbgkwkke", "associated": {"activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [], "createdAt": "2023-08-18T16:37:49.540Z"}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-10-29T00:45:03.581Z", "facets": [{"features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#tag", "tag": "Raptors"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 12, "byteStart": 4}}, {"features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#tag", "tag": "Magic"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 135, "byteStart": 129}}], "langs": ["en"], "reply": {"parent": {"cid": "bafyreihsr7m3vv3vld7kmhcnixehc26upxrkd7rnriiwzkhflpuzlvhpj4", "uri": "at://did:plc:fkpnckg4eqizwxmgrxrgwyxo/app.bsky.feed.post/3myxzvvfvmk2a"}, "root": {"cid": "bafyreigjyqwct2o2cay4qdfwgcttbip6thbc7wooqzns3rq4typazgbqma", "uri": "at://did:plc:fkpnckg4eqizwxmgrxrgwyxo/app.bsky.feed.post/3myxvqv44lk2a"}}, "text": "The #Raptors entered the game with the worst 3-point FG% in the league. They are 8 for 18. And starting to run away with things. #Magic have 14 turnovers and they feast in transition when they get numbers.\n\nORL 51:67 TOR 1:10 2nd"}, "bookmarkCount": 0, "replyCount": 1, "repostCount": 0, "likeCount": 0, "quoteCount": 0, "indexedAt": "2026-10-29T00:45:05.718Z", "labels": []}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:r2e5r4n5kt4q3hayta2irbzg/app.bsky.feed.post/3myxzyjc54s2d", "cid": "bafyreibeg3voaqw4dbevuezgqwcfw5auifizgyuvq6lan7puz2unycniuq", "author": {"did": "did:plc:r2e5r4n5kt4q3hayta2irbzg", "handle": "wolstat.bsky.social", "displayName": "Wolstat", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:r2e5r4n5kt4q3hayta2irbzg/bafkreignv6wdgwfwbdyg2skhyeypeynp5w2gpsnscy6l7xpe62mjdxo5ey", "associated": {"chat": {"allowIncoming": "following"}, "activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [], "createdAt": "2023-09-14T18:55:51.842Z"}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-10-29T00:44:54.312Z", "langs": ["en"], "text": "Scottie Barnes just channelled Vince Carter and DeMar DeRozan with a spectacular 360 dunk. Raptors have taken control with a lot of help from Jamal Shead who has sparked them."}, "bookmarkCount": 0, "replyCount": 0, "repostCount": 0, "likeCount": 7, "quoteCount": 0, "indexedAt": "2026-10-29T00:44:54.577Z", "labels": []}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:fhyu4zjougtr3emjwdulollt/app.bsky.feed.post/3myxzxrgfoc2b", "cid": "bafyreicw667edx7my46p4kykm3xs5padcof5zeivpygx2lmw7imki3mcyq", "author": {"did": "did:plc:fhyu4zjougtr3emjwdulollt", "handle": "smithraptorsbeat.bsky.social", "displayName": "Doug Smith", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:fhyu4zjougtr3emjwdulollt/bafkreiajribnpdrs22kkygn2qxwwowyitv7otscl6mebx6kty7uijwrk3i", "associated": {"activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [], "createdAt": "2024-11-06T22:16:16.879Z"}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-10-29T00:44:29.286Z", "langs": ["en"], "text": "What a tremendous Shead-to-Walter-to-Quickley break ends in an IQ 3\nRaptors rolling in the second quarter and are up 67-51 with 70 seconds left"}, "bookmarkCount": 0, "replyCount": 0, "repostCount": 0, "likeCount": 4, "quoteCount": 0, "indexedAt": "2026-10-29T00:44:29.672Z", "labels": []}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:fkpnckg4eqizwxmgrxrgwyxo/app.bsky.feed.post/3myxzvvfvmk2a", "cid": "bafyreihsr7m3vv3vld7kmhcnixehc26upxrkd7rnriiwzkhflpuzlvhpj4", "author": {"did": "did:plc:fkpnckg4eqizwxmgrxrgwyxo", "handle": "philiprr.bsky.social", "displayName": "Philip Rossman-Reich", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:fkpnckg4eqizwxmgrxrgwyxo/bafkreia5yytn63svxtqdkdptgsmyydn6pq4k5kko77upzeyupxjbgkwkke", "associated": {"activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [], "createdAt": "2023-08-18T16:37:49.540Z"}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-10-29T00:43:26.354Z", "facets": [{"features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#tag", "tag": "Magic's"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 38, "byteStart": 30}}, {"features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#tag", "tag": "Raptors"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 187, "byteStart": 179}}], "langs": ["en"], "reply": {"parent": {"cid": "bafyreiaionicx6aur7ps5oapkpezdvkakohwkx6dcch4h4pumq7mx5azva", "uri": "at://did:plc:fkpnckg4eqizwxmgrxrgwyxo/app.bsky.feed.post/3myxziobatk2a"}, "root": {"cid": "bafyreigjyqwct2o2cay4qdfwgcttbip6thbc7wooqzns3rq4typazgbqma", "uri": "at://did:plc:fkpnckg4eqizwxmgrxrgwyxo/app.bsky.feed.post/3myxvqv44lk2a"}}, "text": "Franz Wagner has seven of the #Magic's 14 turnovers. They have put the ball in Franz's hands to initiate actions. Was always an area he had to grow in. Really struggling with the #Raptors' size and gap pressure today.\n\nORL 51:60 TOR 2:16 2nd"}, "bookmarkCount": 0, "replyCount": 1, "repostCount": 0, "likeCount": 0, "quoteCount": 0, "indexedAt": "2026-10-29T00:43:26.981Z", "labels": []}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:75ywphuamkbx76cq6efue5y5/app.bsky.feed.post/3myxzsc2fos2a", "cid": "bafyreiaw64yq2ov5wtruthsxnmbdxi7bumn4iwfxhh3cqeysuthylw27ua", "author": {"did": "did:plc:75ywphuamkbx76cq6efue5y5", "handle": "jlewenberg.bsky.social", "displayName": "Josh Lewenberg", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:75ywphuamkbx76cq6efue5y5/bafkreih7kszzs5gl72sg5igovpbjfglyrxgpzrq4dfzi27zy5dgx5ep3im", "associated": {"chat": {"allowIncoming": "none"}, "activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [], "createdAt": "2024-11-30T19:46:50.450Z", "verification": {"verifications": [{"issuer": "did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur", "issuerDisplayName": "Bluesky", "issuerHandle": "bsky.app", "uri": "at://did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur/app.bsky.graph.verification/3m4y5jsuu272r", "isValid": true, "createdAt": "2025-11-06T18:02:50.132Z"}], "verifiedStatus": "valid", "trustedVerifierStatus": "none"}}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-10-29T00:41:25.392Z", "langs": ["en"], "text": "Good stuff from the Raptors bench. Easily the best stretch of the young season for both Shead and Battle. CMB much better after a rough first shift (includes an ATB 3). Solid minutes from TJD early. Exactly what you need from your depth pieces with Kawhi out and Poeltl, well..."}, "bookmarkCount": 0, "replyCount": 0, "repostCount": 0, "likeCount": 9, "quoteCount": 0, "indexedAt": "2026-10-29T00:41:25.888Z", "labels": []}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:yx55po6zknijied5vxft2rwa/app.bsky.feed.post/3myxzhgd4h32b", "cid": "bafyreidmtbrerhjsqnqizqql5kjl4mraylkr3mhe7k4myprrdee4gnlgmm", "author": {"did": "did:plc:yx55po6zknijied5vxft2rwa", "handle": "jackborman.bsky.social", "displayName": "Jack Borman", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:yx55po6zknijied5vxft2rwa/bafkreidu24oo5y6igqjjrpl5fhpj73lcrxugvlp3wutryveuqxwog4w5wq", "associated": {"chat": {"allowIncoming": "all"}, "activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [], "createdAt": "2024-11-12T15:44:22.303Z"}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-10-29T00:35:20.773Z", "langs": ["en"], "text": "6 turnovers now for the Wolves and all of them have been careless. \n\n24 turnovers vs the Raptors\n18 against Cleveland\n\nA worrisome trend with no one player at the heart of the issue."}, "bookmarkCount": 0, "replyCount": 1, "repostCount": 0, "likeCount": 2, "quoteCount": 0, "indexedAt": "2026-10-29T00:35:21.076Z", "labels": []}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:r2e5r4n5kt4q3hayta2irbzg/app.bsky.feed.post/3myxzatwzos2d", "cid": "bafyreihjyevngqsde4zle4fxx5plg44hrtelkavt2r6e5c7rbgrhkyyr34", "author": {"did": "did:plc:r2e5r4n5kt4q3hayta2irbzg", "handle": "wolstat.bsky.social", "displayName": "Wolstat", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:r2e5r4n5kt4q3hayta2irbzg/bafkreignv6wdgwfwbdyg2skhyeypeynp5w2gpsnscy6l7xpe62mjdxo5ey", "associated": {"chat": {"allowIncoming": "following"}, "activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [], "createdAt": "2023-09-14T18:55:51.842Z"}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-10-29T00:31:40.176Z", "langs": ["en"], "text": "Wol-stat of the day:\nRaptors entered tonight last in NBA in three-point makes a game (9). Were 24th in 3-pt%\nHave already hit 6 though on 14 attempts.\nYes, very small sample size."}, "bookmarkCount": 0, "replyCount": 0, "repostCount": 0, "likeCount": 3, "quoteCount": 0, "indexedAt": "2026-10-29T00:31:40.478Z", "labels": []}]}